@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = PEGA_AQUI_TU_JWT_DE_SUPABASE

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Público: listar (solo publicados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks?page=1&limit=20&search=

### Admin: listar drafts (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tracks?page=1&limit=20&search=
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: listar todos (published + draft)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tracks?page=1&limit=20&search=&status=all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: crear track (devuelve uploadUrl)
# @name createTrack
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke Test Track",
  "contentType": "audio/mpeg"
}

### Admin: subir archivo directo a R2 (PUT a la uploadUrl)
# Reemplaza ./sample.mp3 por la ruta a tu archivo local.
# IMPORTANTE: este Content-Type DEBE coincidir con el que se usó para firmar (arriba: "audio/mpeg"),
# o R2 puede responder SignatureDoesNotMatch.
PUT {{createTrack.response.body.$.uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./sample.mp3

### Admin: publicar (ya queda visible en endpoints públicos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Público: detalle (solo publicados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}

### Público: stream (302 -> URL firmada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}/stream

### Público: download (302 -> URL firmada attachment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}/download

### Admin: detalle (incluye borradores)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: stream preview (incluye borradores)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tracks/{{createTrack.response.body.$.track.id}}/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
